{"script": "别再踩坑买那种裹满糖霜的芒果干了\n外面卖的芒果干全是糖浆浸泡增重\n一口下去甜得发齁\n吃完嘴里发黏\n全是糖味\n根本尝不到芒果本身的味道！\n试试我们家这款\n只选自然成熟的芒果\n大块厚切\n高温烘干锁香\n配料表干干净净\n只有芒果\n没有额外糖浆\n不加白砂糖\n咬一口果肉厚实有嚼劲\n是芒果本身的清甜果香\n不腻不齁。\n爱吃芒果干的朋友\n别再吃加糖的工业果干了下方小黄车现货不多\n喜欢直接拍\n带回家尝尝原汁原味的芒果干", "asr": {"language": "zh", "audioDuration": 37.9635, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.76, "text": "別再採坑買那種果滿糖霜的芒果乾了", "words": [{"text": "別", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.24, "keyword": false}, {"text": "再", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.44, "keyword": false}, {"text": "採", "start": 0.44, "end": 0.62, "keyword": false}, {"text": "坑", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.8, "keyword": false}, {"text": "買", "start": 0.8, "end": 1.04, "keyword": false}, {"text": "那", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.16, "keyword": false}, {"text": "種", "start": 1.16, "end": 1.3, "keyword": false}, {"text": "果", "start": 1.3, "end": 1.44, "keyword": false}, {"text": "滿", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.56, "keyword": false}, {"text": "糖", "start": 1.56, "end": 1.76, "keyword": false}, {"text": "霜", "start": 1.76, "end": 1.96, "keyword": false}, {"text": "的", "start": 1.96, "end": 2.12, "keyword": false}, {"text": "芒", "start": 2.12, "end": 2.22, "keyword": false}, {"text": "果", "start": 2.22, "end": 2.38, "keyword": false}, {"text": "乾", "start": 2.38, "end": 2.54, "keyword": false}, {"text": "了", "start": 2.54, "end": 2.76, "keyword": false}]}, {"start": 2.76, "end": 5.8, "text": "外面賣的芒果乾全是糖漿進泡增重", "words": [{"text": "外", "start": 2.76, "end": 3.38, "keyword": false}, {"text": "面", "start": 3.38, "end": 3.52, "keyword": false}, {"text": "賣", "start": 3.52, "end": 3.66, "keyword": false}, {"text": "的", "start": 3.66, "end": 3.8, "keyword": false}, {"text": "芒", "start": 3.8, "end": 3.9, "keyword": false}, {"text": "果", "start": 3.9, "end": 4.1, "keyword": false}, {"text": "乾", "start": 4.1, "end": 4.22, "keyword": false}, {"text": "全", "start": 4.22, "end": 4.46, "keyword": false}, {"text": "是", "start": 4.46, "end": 4.62, "keyword": false}, {"text": "糖", "start": 4.62, "end": 4.76, "keyword":